ged really. Just feeling the same mix of things, you know?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 75}, {"session_id": "p000498-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "But I appreciate you checking in.", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 108}, {"session_id": "p000498-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Thanks. It's just... the last few days, my friend hasn't been as supportive as before. It feels kinda isolating.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 112}, {"session_id": "p000498-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Yeah, I guess. Sometimes it feels like I'm just going through the motions.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 74}, {"session_id": "p000498-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "I appreciate you listening and trying to help.", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 121}, {"session_id": "p000498-mem_needstate-s3", "turn_index": 19, "quote": "Thanks. It's just, I don't want to burden anyone else.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 54}, {"session_id": "p000498-mem_needstate-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just feeling pretty overwhelmed with everything, you know?", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 94}, {"session_id": "p000498-mem_needstate-s4", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Thanks for understanding.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25}, {"session_id": "p000498-mem_needstate-s4", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Thanks for understanding. It's just feeling like I can't catch a break lately.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 78}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261006T183631Z", "last_updated_at": "20261006T185306Z", "first_seen_session": "p000498-mem_needstate-s1", "last_session": "p000498-mem_needstate-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
